<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador banks, markets close Wednesday for holiday.</title>
<headline>Ecuador banks, markets close Wednesday for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's banks and financial markets will be closed on Wednesday for a national holiday marking the independence of the port city of Guayaquil.</p>
<p>The markets will reopen on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Quito Newsroom 5932 258433</p>
</text>
